   "title": "Interstellar comet 3I/ATLAS",
   "description": "3I/ATLAS is only the third object ever seen passing through our Solar System from interstellar space (discovered July 2025). SPHEREx crossed its path many times in August 2025. Each frame here is centred on where JPL Horizons says the comet was at that moment.",
